# The store under a key that nobody knows leaves the accessor that has escaped to `unknown`: what its body does to the instance counts as impossible.
# FORM: AsRead
# RUN: valueflow-apply
# OPTIONS: exclude=CodeOutsideImage sabotage=StoresUnderUnknownKeysEnterNoSetterThatEscaped
# CHECK: layout L0 {{*}}impossibleMutations=[{{*}}ChangeIntegrity
# PROGRAM-OF: escaped-setter-freezes.ir
